      *################################################################*        
      *                                                                         
      * Copy-område R791CICS.                                                   
      * Interface for å returnere alle date fra CICS DFHEIBLK.                  
      *                                                                         
      * En normal kall sekvens for å åpne en sesjon kan se slik ut              
      *                                                                         
      *    Initialize                          R791CICS-Dfheiblk                
      *    Set  R791CICS-Versjon         To    True                             
      *                                                                         
      *    Call  'F791CICS'                                                     
      *          Using By Reference      R791CICS-Dfheiblk                      
      *                By Reference      R7919999-Error                         
      *    End-Call                                                             
      *                                                                         
      *    If  Not  R7919999-Retur-Ok                                           
      *       Feil                                                              
      *    End-If                                                               
      *                                                                         
      *                                                                         
      *################################################################*        
      * Dato ! Si! Endringens art                                 ! 3A !        
      *------+---+------------------------------------------------+----+        
      *041197!JPK! Nytt copy-område                               !    !        
